  <main class="page page--wide">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 · Draft 提案</p>
      <h1>Transformer 一次并行得到四个槽位；Markov 小头再串行生成 <code>a→b→c→d</code></h1>
      <p class="lead">Draft 模型真正 forward 的输入是 <code>[X,MASK,MASK,MASK]</code>，不是最终候选 <code>[X,a,b,c,d]</code>。后者直到 <code>DraftProposal</code> 返回、Target 候选矩阵装配时才出现。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>关键不变量</strong> · <code>W=G+1=5</code>，Draft Transformer 只运行 <code>G=4</code> 行</span><span><strong>对象边界</strong> · MASK 形状与真实 draft tokens 分开保存</span><span><strong>证据范围</strong> · 当前源码 <code>f01a0c7f97ec</code> · 静态核验</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择讲解路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>
    <section class="handoff" aria-label="Draft 提案交接契约">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入 · 跨轮状态</b><span><code>draft_input : DFlashDraftInputV2</code> 提供 anchor <code>X</code>；<code>batch : ScheduleBatch</code> 提供 prefix 与请求索引。</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入 · 本轮预留</b><span><code>verify_window : VerifyWindow</code> 已为每请求预留 <code>W=5</code> 个 Target verify 位置。</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输出 · 提案对象</b><span><code>proposal : DraftProposal</code> 携带真实 token、hidden、采样分布材料与可选 confidence。</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>下一消费者</b><span><code>self : DSparkWorkerV2</code> 取 token；04 的 <code>self._verify_planner</code> 计算 budget/layout。</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="draft-main-title">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 对象与数据变换</p><h2 id="draft-main-title"><code>DFlashDraftInputV2 + VerifyWindow</code> 如何变成 <code>DraftProposal</code></h2><p class="section__intro">播放顺序写出接收者实例、具体类、关键参数、返回值与下一消费者。紫色表示设备执行；蓝色表示对象或张量。</p></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="7">
        <div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>一轮提案</strong> · B=1，prefix=20，G=4，W=5</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#draft-flow-canvas">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="visual__body">
          <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons" aria-label="提案流程播放控制"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status aria-live="polite"></div></div>
          <div id="draft-flow-canvas" class="canvas-scroll"><div class="data-transform draft-flow">
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="0"><b>01 · 跨轮锚点</b><p><code>draft_input : DFlashDraftInputV2</code></p><div class="object-mini"><span data-kind="data">bonus_tokens=[X]</span><span>new_seq_lens=[20]</span></div><div class="token-set"><span class="token" data-kind="data" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-x">X@20</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="1"><b>02 · 预留窗口</b><p><code>verify_window : VerifyWindow</code><br><code>alloc_verify_window()</code></p><div class="object-mini"><span data-kind="data">positions=[20,21,22,23,24]</span><span>cache=L20…L24</span><span data-kind="off">第 5 格只留给 Target verify</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="2" data-kind="main"><b>03 · 装配 Draft ForwardBatch</b><p><code>self._proposer._run_forward()</code></p><div class="token-set"><span class="token" data-kind="data" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-x">X</span><span class="token" data-kind="off">MASK</span><span class="token" data-kind="off">MASK</span><span class="token" data-kind="off">MASK</span></div><div class="object-mini"><span>forward_mode=TARGET_VERIFY</span><span>positions=20…23</span><span>out_cache_loc=L20…L23</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="3" data-kind="cuda"><b>04 · Draft Transformer</b><p><code>self._proposer.draft_model_runner : ModelRunner</code><br><code>forward(draft_forward_batch)</code></p><div class="object-mini"><span data-kind="cuda">一次 forward · 4 行</span><span>raw_hidden[4,H]</span><span>draft_hidden_3d[1,4,H]</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="4"><b>05 · 基础 logits</b><p><code>self._proposer.draft_model.compute_base_logits(raw_hidden)</code></p><div class="object-mini"><span data-kind="data">base_logits[1,4,V]</span><span>confidence_tap · 可选</span><span data-kind="off">尚未产生 a/b/c/d</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="5" data-kind="main"><b>06 · Markov 串行修正与采样</b><p><code>sample_draft_block()</code> → <code>markov_head.sample_block()</code></p><div class="token-set"><span class="token" data-kind="main" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-a">a</span><span class="token" data-kind="main" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-b">b</span><span class="token" data-kind="main" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-c">c</span><span class="token" data-kind="main" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-d">d</span></div><div class="object-mini"><span>corrected_logits[1,4,V]</span><span>greedy_mask + temperatures</span></div></article>
            <article class="transform-stage" data-step-node="6" data-kind="main"><b>07 · 返回 DraftProposal</b><p><code>proposal : DraftProposal</code></p><div class="object-mini"><span data-kind="off">draft_block_ids=[X,M,M,M]</span><span data-kind="main">draft_block.draft_tokens=[a,b,c,d]</span><span>draft_hidden[1,4,H]</span><span>confidence/tap/folded · 可选</span></div></article>
          </div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="route-note" aria-label="三条路线在 Draft 阶段的差异">
        <article data-kind="main" data-routes="static-greedy"><b>STATIC · 贪心</b><p>每个 step 使用 <code>argmax(step_logits)</code>。proposal 可折叠并不保证后续 accept 折叠；04 的 STATIC 仍得到 <code>layout=None</code>。</p></article>
        <article data-kind="data" data-routes="compact-sampling"><b>COMPACT · 随机采样</b><p>按每请求 temperature 与 greedy mask 采样，并保留 <code>corrected_logits + temperatures</code>；06 用它们重建实际 <code>P_D</code>。</p></article>
        <article data-kind="guard" data-routes="folded-greedy"><b>FOLDED · 贪心</b><p>仅当 draft sampler 存在、Draft CUDA 图命中且全贪心，token 才直接读 graph buffer；此时 <code>corrected_logits=None</code>。</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="shape-title">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 两种长度语义</p><h2 id="shape-title"><code>seq_lens=[20]</code> 与 <code>seq_lens_cpu=[24]</code> 同时成立，但不是同一个概念</h2><p class="section__intro">前者保留请求进入 verify window 前的设备侧 prefix 边界；后者把本次 Draft 的四个 token 行计入 CPU 侧总 token 计数。它们都不表示“a,b,c,d 已被 Target 接受”。</p></div>
      <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>具体数据</strong> · <code>draft_forward_batch = ForwardBatch(...)</code></span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#draft-shapes">放大辅助图</button></div><div class="visual__body" id="draft-shapes">
        <div class="shape-contract">
          <article class="shape-card"><b>设备注意力前缀</b><code>seq_lens = [20]<br>positions = [20,21,22,23]<br>out_cache_loc = [L20,L21,L22,L23]</code></article>
          <article class="shape-card" data-kind="guard"><b>CPU 调度计数</b><code>seq_lens_cpu = [20] + G = [24]<br>seq_lens_sum = 24<br>不是 committed length</code></article>
          <article class="shape-card" data-kind="main"><b>窗口与提案</b><code>VerifyWindow = 5 slots<br>Draft forward = 4 rows<br>Draft tokens = [a,b,c,d]<br>Target input = [X,a,b,c,d]</code></article>
        </div>
        <div class="canvas-scroll compare-rails">
          <div class="token-rail" aria-label="Target 验证窗口五个位置"><div class="token-rail__label">VerifyWindow · W=5</div><div class="token" data-kind="data" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-x">20 · X</div><div class="token" data-kind="data">21 · a 槽</div><div class="token" data-kind="data">22 · b 槽</div><div class="token" data-kind="data">23 · c 槽</div><div class="token" data-kind="data">24 · d 槽</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div></div>
          <div class="token-rail" aria-label="Draft Transformer 四个输入行"><div class="token-rail__label">Draft forward · G=4</div><div class="token" data-kind="data" tabindex="0" data-entity="token-x">20 · X</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">21 · MASK</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">22 · MASK</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">23 · MASK</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">24 · 不运行</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="token" data-kind="off">—</div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
      <a class="topic-link" data-nav href="dspark-markov-head-internals.html"><b>03A · 进入 Markov Head 内部机制 →</b><span>逐步观察四个 hidden 同时完成后，为什么 logits 修正与采样仍必须按 <code>X→a→b→c→d</code> 串行。</span></a>
    </section>
    <details class="source-details"><summary>为什么、如果省略、易错边界与源码锚点</summary><div class="source-details__body">
      <div class="callouts"><div class="callout" data-kind="data"><b>为什么 · W 比 G 多 1</b><p>Target 验证还需要 anchor 所在行预测第一个 draft token，因此窗口是 <code>anchor + G drafts</code>。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>易错 · TARGET_VERIFY 的接收者</b><p>模式用于复用 block-shaped runner/attention 分派；实际接收者仍是 Draft <code>ModelRunner</code>，不是 Target worker。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>如果省略 Markov</b><p>直接独立采四个 base logits，会让 b/c/d 看不到 a/b/c；proposal 与实际 <code>P_D</code> 都改变。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>如果丢失 corrected logits</b><p>sampling 路径无法重建 Markov 修正与 temperature 后的 proposal 概率；06 不能正确做拒绝采样修正。</p></div></div>
      <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_worker_v2.py:482–545</code><span><code>self : DSparkWorkerV2</code> 取得跨轮输入、预留 verify window，并调用 <code>self._proposer.propose()</code>。</span></div>
      <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_draft.py:241–336, 361–426</code><span><code>DraftBlockProposer.propose/_run_forward</code> 构造 ForwardBatch、执行 Draft ModelRunner、采样并封装 <code>DraftProposal</code>。</span></div>
      <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_draft.py:166–238</code><span>greedy/sampling 分支与返回的采样分布材料。</span></div>
      <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/models/dspark.py:34–64, 67–286</code><span>串行 Markov loop 与 vanilla/gated/RNN 三个具体 head。</span></div>
    </div></details>
